  <description>The curl packages provide the libcurl library and the curl utility for downloading files from servers using various protocols, including HTTP, FTP, and LDAP.

Security Fix(es):

* curl: OAUTH2 bearer bypass in connection re-use (CVE-2022-22576)

* curl: credential leak on redirect (CVE-2022-27774)

* curl: auth/cookie leak on redirect (CVE-2022-27776)

* curl: TLS and SSH connection too eager reus</description>
